Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ggml — https://github.com/ggml-org/ggml
Copyright (c) 2023-2024 The ggml authors
Licensed under the MIT License.

  Chaos links against a prebuilt ggml as a static library and does not vendor,
  redistribute or modify its source. `core/ggml` contains only Rust FFI
  declarations written against ggml's public C API.

  Quantized matmul kernels are years of specialist SIMD work. Chaos does not
  reimplement them; it owns memory, residency, streaming and the token loop, and
  borrows the arithmetic. See core/ggml/build.rs.

  MIT License text: https://github.com/ggml-org/ggml/blob/master/LICENSE

