Cinzel, IBM Plex Mono, UnifrakturMaguntia
Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

  Cinzel — Copyright 2020 The Cinzel Project Authors
           (https://github.com/NDISCOVER/Cinzel)
  IBM Plex Mono — Copyright (c) 2017 IBM Corp. with Reserved Font Name "Plex"
  UnifrakturMaguntia — Copyright (c) 2010, j. 'mach' wust, with Reserved Font
           Name UnifrakturMaguntia. Copyright (c) 2009, Peter Wiegel.

  **These are embedded in the binary, not linked.** `assets/grimoire/fonts.css`
  carries all three as base64 WOFF2, latin subsets, and `chaos_arch::grimoire`
  compiles that file into every build — so a Chaos binary and the pages it serves
  at /qr and /scan contain the fonts themselves. They are Google Fonts' own
  subsets, byte-for-byte, re-encoded and otherwise unmodified; no Reserved Font
  Name is used for a modified version.

  The OFL requires these notices to be preserved with the fonts, which is why
  they are here rather than only in the repository. Full licence text and the
  regeneration command: assets/grimoire/fonts/NOTICE.

